      "TEST-COMP-NODE-004": "Preserves node-local final validation when a request originates from the control plane.",
      "TEST-COMP-NODE-005": "Returns the recorded result for equivalent repeated requests and rejects request identity reuse with a different body.",
      "TEST-COMP-NODE-006": "Stages artifacts without activation and prevents partial authoritative state.",
      "TEST-COMP-NODE-007": "Activates complete compatible artifacts atomically and preserves or restores the previous valid state on failure.",
